2026-07-27T12:32:18.4961439Z i /tmp/RtmpmdcOny/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:32:18.4961900Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:32:18.4962726Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:32:18.4963177Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:32:18.4963969Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:32:18.4964982Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:32:18.4965939Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
